I just had an idea for the newer versions of nethack about Fortune Cookies.
I doubt if anyone really uses these anymore, except for newer players, but
it seems a good a idea to have them give a different fortune based on their
cursed/uncursed/blessed status.  It would not be difficult to but a 1 byte
flag on each of the fortunes defining it as bad or untrue/medium/true
depending on the cursed state of the cookie.  That way, if you read a cursed
f. cookie, you get a misleading message, or if you read a blessed one you
get a more helpful message.

I'm pretty sure that most everyone has gone and read the rumor file anyway,
and this would just make it easier to cheat.  But it still seems like a good
idea to me.

